{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DvxVgpdtit1792709201.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>開雲集團第三季收入33.45億歐元、折合約294億港元，按年升不足百分之1，當中旗艦品牌Gucci的表現較差，同店銷售跌百分之6，跌幅大過市場預期的百分之3.3。</p><p></p><p>Gucci第三季度收入12.91億歐元、折合約113億港元，按年跌百分之4。季內直營零售網絡同店銷售跌百分之9，反映比較基數較高，以及新產品帶動效應較第二季減弱。</p><p></p><p>開雲集團財務總監普洛表示，公司表現未達預期水平。Gucci上季度在北美市場出現放緩，而最具挑戰的中國市場消費仍然低迷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.623404+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":223,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:20.882573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T23:37:54.814778+00:00","content_hash":"b3887442a25c74e51c743590b50c623722825e6d8664b5513f3cf7d84b042438","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T23:40:03.623404+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}